# ORACLY AI Agent Guide

Full spec: `docs/AI_AGENT_GUIDE.md` · Stack: Master Directive → Development Charter → Manifesto → EPICs → OOS → PRINCIPLE-001 → Gold Standard

ORACLY is a **premium digital sanctuary for reflection** — not a tarot app.

## Before every change (all must be yes)

Calmer? · More trust? · Clearer? · Respects intelligence? · Fits ORACLY identity?

**Any no → do not implement.**

## Never

Unnecessary animations · Second design language · Duplicate components · Rewrite stable systems · Complexity for visual impact

## Always

Reuse systems · Maintainable code · Subtle motion · Consistency over novelty · Performance · Accessibility

## Goals

**Emotional:** calm, curious, respected, present — never manipulated  
**Design:** interface disappears, experience remains  
**Engineering:** future developers understand immediately

## Final rule

More **intentional** → continue. Only **different** → stop and rethink.
